## 2. Why Do We Use Modules?

Imagine putting **500 functions into one Python file**.

That becomes difficult to:

* Read
* Maintain
* Debug
* Reuse

Instead, we can organize our code into separate files:

```text
project/
│
├── main.py
├── math_utils.py
├── employee_utils.py
